      "writtenOn": "2025-09-09T14:21:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It does fire on Linux + CMake for me, but only as a warning, it doesn\u0027t get raised to an error and I didn\u0027t see it fire for Linux + GN, which I am pretty sure it should have fired for.\n\nBriefly looking at the defines, it looks like it is a no-op for MSVC and GCC, so it will only fire on Clang. Dawn is doing some things to suppress it :-/",
