      "writtenOn": "2025-09-09T14:35:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could you briefly explain where the error is here? As far as I can tell `buffer-\u003edata() + total_bytes_copied` will never overflow.\nI am working on MSVC only.",
      "parentUuid": "63857821_1a1dcdcd",
      "revId": "e63afc0f95ffaf9a10a6040bce2456a87e4d302d",
